      "dom_id": "step-q178228",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$2x+7x+2z=${{field-1}}\n$x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$z$",
      "worked_solution": "We have two like terms, $2x$ and $7x.$ \n\nTo collect these like terms, we combine them into a single term, adding their coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+7x+2z & = \\\\ (2x+7x)+2z & = \\\\ (2+7)x+2z & = \\\\ 9\\,x+2\\,z\\end{aligned}\n$$",
