      "problem": "$6+10y-3y-5y=${{field-1}}\n$+$\n{{field-2}}\n$y$",
      "worked_solution": "We have three like terms, $10y,$ $-3y,$ and $-5y.$ \n\nTo collect these like terms, we combine them into a single term, adding their coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6+10y-3y-5y & = \\\\ 6+(10-3-5)y & = \\\\ 6+2\\,y\\end{aligned}\n$$",
