      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "$8t-6t+2t+5=$",
      "worked_solution": "We have three like terms, $8t,$ $-6t,$ and $2t.$ \n\nTo collect these like terms, we combine them into a single term, adding their coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8t-6t+2t+5 & = \\\\ (8-6+2)t+5 & = \\\\ 4t+5\\end{aligned}\n$$",
