      "problem": "$8a+3b+11a=${{field-1}}\n$a\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$b$",
      "worked_solution": "We rearrange the terms so that the like terms, $8a$ and $11a$, are together.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8a+3b+11a & = \\\\ {{8a+11a}_{⏟}}_{a\\text{ terms}}+3b & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{8a+11a}_{⏟}\\,+\\,3b & = \\\\ (8+11)a+3b & = \\\\ 19\\,a+3\\,b\\end{aligned}\n$$",
